{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Friday Kwon is a young witch who makes potions for her family shop. But when her mother breaks her arms in an accident, Friday returns to her post as a delivery girl for the first time since her own accident left her paralyzed from the waist down.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Rain Forest Witch Company doesn't take kindly to this and they'll do everything in their power to make sure that Friday doesn't deliver any potions. Take control of Friday and navigate the unfriendly skies as she tries to get potions to her customers and keep the family business afloat.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prefer a more chill game? Take your time on the levels and don't sweat the small mistakes like a lost or late package. But if you like more of a challenge try your hand at being the best delivery girl whose only flaw is being a perfectionist. Or maybe you prefer something inbetween? The choice is yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gameplay and story by Emerson Arriety</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Background and story art by SleepySoren</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sprite art by Vioclipse</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >User interface art by Frances Genevieve Philip</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Music by Apocalyptic Universe</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4141430?t=1761843581","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4141430/d0bb17811e26e96057409a82adfa512105e40389/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761843581","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4141430/31f723b5345acb20c45a1dd6a2afb24e96618cfc/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761843581","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4141430/31f723b5345acb20c4